{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂风穿刺"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Gale Thrust"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退1名敌人并为其添加“丛林印记”。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Kafra knocks back an enemy and inflicts a Forest Mark on them."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卡夫拉会优先攻击处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，“丛林印记”最多只会存在1个。使用终极技能时，卡夫拉为一名敌人添加“丛林印记”，对其造成迅猛绝伦的一击，造成500% + 50% ATK伤害，并击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. Kafra prioritizes attacking the enemy who carries Forest Mark. Kafra inflicts a Forest Mark on an enemy when casting Ultimate and launches a mighty strike, dealing 500% + 50% ATK damage and knocking them back for 2-tile. Only 1 Forest Mark exists per attack."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":177,"end":183,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":173,"end":187,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 510% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 520% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/